WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,910
This fund for undercover special activities

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:04,510
Can you give me an advance first?

3
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:05,710
I'm poor

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:06,710
No more money

5
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:13,090
I can only go to the cafeteria tomorrow to eat white steamed buns and pickles. Warranty

6
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:21,430
That's right

7
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,830
Zhang Wei, wait a moment

8
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:37,450
The president is looking for you to look for me, Zhang Wei

9
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:39,670
How do you feel about being in the club these days?

10
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:40,870
Very good

11
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:43,270
The folk tales told by the seniors are so exciting

12
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:45,670
Than those rigid bed and breakfast theories we learned in class

13
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:46,870
Much more interesting
